description	"The Sith Acolyte

This Sith is battle-capable but has not yet achieved mastery nor is specialized for any particular role. It is a more common and numerous level of Sith. 

^2Weaponry:
- Lightsaber
-- ^3Yellow ^7/ ^1Red ^7/ ^4Blue ^7Styles
-- Saber / Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (2)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump  (2)
- Push  (2)
- Pull  (2)
- Sense (1)
- Mind Trick (1) ^5[CS4]
- Speed (2)
- Protect (1) ^5[CS3]
- Grip  (2)

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (2)

^2Strengths^7: More numerous then other Jedi Classes, balanced lightsaber and force power abilities.
^1Weaknesses^7: Generally outclassed by the other Jedi Types."